usly punishes chaos </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the craft, break the rules, or burn the whole place down. <strong>It’s your kitchen. Your call.</strong> </p>", "short_description": "A realistic cooking sim where every ingredient reacts with real physics. Master 80+ dishes in Career mode or go wild in Sandbox as you cook, experiment, or cause total kitchen chaos in a fully interactive chef’s playground.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Russian, French, Italian, Korean, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/641320/8e52427e8dfcfcd7f407fe1a82b19b2f46cd7ff7/header.jpg?t=1780667817", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/641320/cdc137e524f4a93ee8a3026baccee47f0a8909e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780667817", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/641320/cdc137e524f4a93ee8a3026baccee47f0a8909e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780667817", "website": "https://bigcheesestudio.com/en/home-eng/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 3550 / FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 660Ti 3GB / R9 270X 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 4570 / Ryzen 7 1700x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6GB / RX 480 GB 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></l